{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"ebaddca55581db1a","name":"斗破苍穹之少年归来","pic":"data/covers/3f58e1ecd89170af.jpg","note":"已完结","type":"国产剧","content":"该剧讲述了热血少年萧炎的成长史，在萧炎完成与纳兰嫣然的三年之约后，萧家却突逢云岚宗的袭击，父亲萧战亦被对方掳走。为拯救父亲，重振萧家荣光，萧炎在师父药尘的建议下回到迦南学院，欲取得学院天焚炼气塔下的异火陨落心炎，提升实力再战云岚宗。在这里，萧炎不仅与青梅竹马萧薰儿重逢，也与其他小伙伴结识相伴，面对斗气大陆的重重挑战与危机，并肩迎难而上。","updatedAt":"2025-11-21 14:54:37","aliases":["斗破苍穹之少年归来"],"keywords":["斗破苍穹"],"origins":[{"configKey":"qist-lzi","configName":"量子资源（qist 配置）","configUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","siteKey":"qist-lzi","siteName":"量子资源（qist 配置）","siteApi":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","siteType":1,"detailUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/?ac=detail&ids=77774"}],"episodes":[{"name":"第01集","sources":[{"url":{"v":1,"n":"GjbowkoxDEi0BBkd","c":"27fe2zo0hoHp4pudmUvfHyc-JNnAYFhUjcFmqcClhHsWxviFEeHceS8gUth-Q6S6iXmN-o7zIJ8MH7x6GXY5VGLZiUkEdi6bhQ"},"origins":[{"configKey":"qist-lzi","siteKey":"qist-lzi","line":"lzm3u8"}]}]},{"name":"第02集","sources":[{"url":{"v":1,"n":"5gsSVmwGwq-mDxNb","c":"bRobrHlvTn5sXXLqBHnVO_gWUzjyVkac8iGyPMaSZbVmYzja8325HuVImhhTwAMnLNGQ90DhX9IyZY_Vj6ypsPdSN8hPaNbSPg"},"origins":[{"configKey":"qist-lzi","siteKey":"qist-lzi","line":"lzm3u8"}]}]},{"name":"第03集","sources":[{"url":{"v":1,"n":"4gO7cC7m48CpHULB","c":"IRoHXAhEzfgf71SWWwd4vCy7kIO99-CdurGs5XzR0t1bKBMMzZj5y4JMDr8L1lNRK_JrQmcFZOcSjrUVshqWg1IRPD8XEEqstQ"},"origins":[{"configKey":"qist-lzi","siteKey":"qist-lzi","line":"lzm3u8"}]}]},{"name":"第04集","sources":[{"url":{"v":1,"n":"xeMhrVUNhaEbieEE","c":"pICrAxG8PgteYCgIdOprAL0QdD2YKxtYC_IOBHz5Ead-qjeLm6biuYlSGdycUi7xUznTEJlKOmBPuuFKIAjafqu_5-V3-RvB3w"},"origins":[{"configKey":"qist-lzi","siteKey":"qist-lzi","line":"lzm3u8"}]}]},{"name":"第05集","sources":[{"url":{"v":1,"n":"Zgf-2nmKr6ZMS2FS","c":"GpAJDcDvG_foeiqYfChCrQhxvVNv-0nVtddHBS1q1IIOLhyp_1sQ1XRSW8_NqLmcWBZTaCSWd0K82hi51h_w6kz3QoHZpUn6mg"},"origins":[{"configKey":"qist-lzi","siteKey":"qist-lzi","line":"lzm3u8"}]}]},{"name":"第06集","sources":[{"url":{"v":1,"n":"cTVjUdrY